st/`. On main c4b1b8ed:\n\n- 7,307 comment lines. Many repeat what the case name says, and AGENTS.md asks for terse comments.\n- 1,036 jq calls, each one a process start. Common checks can be helpers in `test/lib.sh`.\n- 393 `t_stub` calls (gh 76, docker 55, systemctl 47). Tests such as `dev_test.sh` swap docker stubs back and forth inline. Stubs used in many files go into `test/lib.sh`.\n- `test/lib.sh` (1,349 lines) has helpers for programs whose shell tests are gone (`t_dispatch`, `t_cycle` and others). Remove those with no caller left.\n- The helper files `work_lib.sh`, `docker_args.sh`, `top_lib.sh` and `preview_lib.sh` go when the last file using each is ported.\n- Headers that name old bash paths (`libexec/preview`, `libexec/attach`, `libexec/store`) name the Rust code instead.\n\nNo case changes what it asserts. Lower `scripts/test-lines.max` to the new count.\n\nStep T15 of the v2 plan, last: after the ports. Based on `refactor/coding-standard-v2`, through the merge train.\n\nPart of #2597. Before the 2.0 trio tag.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tehas-app/tehas-factory/issues/2824/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tehas-app/tehas-factory/issues/2824/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}
